### =====================================================================================
### 8. Rate limiting / lockout smoke tests (run manually, not part of the normal flow above)
### =====================================================================================

### Run this one 6 times in a row with a wrong password to see 401 x5 then 423 LOCKED.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword1"
}

### Run this one 6+ times in under a minute to see 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS (default limit is 5/min).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@example.com"
}
